Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:05.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am near my limit, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:08.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the same thing\Ngoes for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:13.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if you can hide your\Ndecaying body with clothing,\Nyou cannot disguise the smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:15.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hohenheim...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:20.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:23.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the first time in hundreds of years\Nthat we've seen each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should have a nice long talk with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.12,0:00:29.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I haven't even\Ntried out this young body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:33.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I have a wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:36.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I have had husbands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.59,0:00:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Many, many, many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't, then the secret of my slowly aging body would have become known.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:49.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For me, Trisha was my first and my last—\Nthe first woman I ever loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:51.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:56.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four hundred years ago,\Nwhen we first met,\Nand I didn't know any better,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:00:58.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you whispered words of love to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps I'm remembering wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:09.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On that day, four hundred years ago, \Nwe finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.25,0:01:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There were those who had escaped the witch hunts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.21,0:01:19.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and those who were just waiting for death from the black plague.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:26.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over and over, we used their lives\Nin our experiments\Nand obtained a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:55.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the reaction from that transmutation left you nearly dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.17,0:02:01.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so using the Philosopher's Stone, I bonded your soul to the body of another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:11.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, we had obtained eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.10,0:02:18.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, you've used\Nthe Philosopher's Stone\Nto transfer your souls around\Nover and over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.77,0:02:22.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.23,0:02:22.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.61,0:02:25.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the whole reason why\Nyou had us seek out someone who could make a Philosopher's Stone was...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.99,0:02:33.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I found that it became necessary, once Hohenheim of Light left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:38.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why? Why did you\Ndisappear from my sight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.84,0:02:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dante,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.38,0:02:45.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there is no such thing\Nas eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:49.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:55.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those who obtain it are set free from the Law of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.81,0:02:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no need to pay a price\Nin order to obtain something, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.73,0:03:04.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We sought it and found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.13,0:04:53.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aah! You can't put that much salt in, and you've got too much cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:05:01.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cooking is a science, \Njust like making Automail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.69,0:05:04.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to make things exact and according to calculations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.98,0:05:08.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And with this newly made oven of mine,\Nit will turn out perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.61,0:05:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With this knob, you can adjust it to whatever temperature you want in a snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:13.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has a timer function you can set for the right number of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:17.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It has this heat-resistant glass, so you can see what's happening inside at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:18.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.49,0:05:19.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cooking is an art.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.37,0:05:21.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:25.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It takes imagination and a sense of adventure that cannot be pigeonholed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:26.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cooking is a science!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.75,0:05:28.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's not. It's an art!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:33.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:35.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a guest, so you go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.51,0:05:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, we're like family now—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.39,0:05:38.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry and answer that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:38.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:50.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers are there, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:57.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shaw-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.53,0:05:58.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.49,0:06:02.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their voice was strange for some reason,\Nbut they said their name\Nwas Shaw-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.16,0:06:03.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shaw-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.12,0:06:07.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, they said to tell you\Nthey'd like to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whenever you came back here would be fine, they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.13,0:06:13.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And another thing—they were crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.22,0:06:19.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:24.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm! Wow, that looks delicious! Brother is going to be thrilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:29.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.07,0:06:33.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to\Nyour clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.19,0:06:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.11,0:06:36.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, just went on a little outing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.41,0:06:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made it look like we were setting out to head north.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:43.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I deliberately left some eyewitnesses, and on the way back, I fell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.20,0:06:44.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I should have gone with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:48.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what if you really {\i1}were{\i0}\Ndiscovered by the homunculi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.59,0:06:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, did anything happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:55.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We seem to have gotten a strange phone call a little while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:58.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nobody we know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.14,0:07:00.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was probably\Nthe police trying to find us, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.97,0:07:01.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:05.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.78,0:07:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who recommended \NEdward Elric to be a State Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:25.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What shame he has brought to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we certain that the boy was \Nconnected with the uprising in Liore?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:34.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to the report, a year ago in Liore,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.42,0:07:38.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he exposed a priest of Leto\Nwho had been misusing alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:42.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, the truth of the matter is,\Nthe priest continued to thrive following that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:47.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and consequently, a situation arose\Nwhere we had to intervene militarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That intervention was overzealously enforced, and the civilians turned against the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you criticizing my mission strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:58.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looking at Colonel Mustang's\Nservice record,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it is clear that he is an excellent soldier who has sworn his loyalty to the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:09.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.67,0:08:13.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I do not understand why you would put\Na halt to the search for the Elric brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:18.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We thought the Elric brothers would return to their home,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:20.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so we put out a\Ndragnet in the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.01,0:08:24.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, they appear to have gone straight north.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.47,0:08:26.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,North? To Drachma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:30.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's it! They're in contact with those savages, are they?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:34.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major Armstrong's squad has begun a search in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, I have learned of \Nan even more serious matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.65,0:08:40.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,which is why I have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.57,0:08:43.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A serious matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:48.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you like, I could have everyone step outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:52.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, this is about your secretary, Captain Juliet Douglas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:54.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, this is sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:57.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She is on leave right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.42,0:08:58.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.46,0:09:02.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have serious doubts\Nabout her military service.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, there is a possibility that she was involved in the circumstances
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:07.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,surrounding the murder of Brigadier General Hughes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.27,0:09:13.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you certain of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.67,0:09:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have a crush on her, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:10:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, we all heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gone and done\Nsomething bold again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:05.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you deliberately\Ndo something to provoke him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.16,0:10:11.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter whether or not\Nthe Führer is a homunculus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:15.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, those who call themselves homunculi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:19.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,have spent a long time sacrificing human lives\Nto create a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:27.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then there is a possibility that the civil war in Ishbal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:27.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was engineered in order to\Nbring about a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They would intentionally start a war?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.39,0:10:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is it that people seek the Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Riches... glory... domination...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.48,0:10:40.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eternal life...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.28,0:10:43.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.19,0:10:47.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When a person loses\Nthose who are around them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.45,0:10:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and is caught up in despair,\Nthey seek the Philosopher's Stone\Nas their only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.54,0:10:56.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In the middle of the\Nirregular conditions of war,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:11:00.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the morals that say that one must not sacrifice the lives of others vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:04.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is true that ever since\Nthe current Führer took power,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.63,0:11:07.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the country has been at war\Nsomewhere or other.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.43,0:11:09.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And we've won every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.18,0:11:11.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't have any complaints over going to war.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:13.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.89,0:11:17.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But when it's about making people stand at the brink of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.39,0:11:20.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in order to get a\NPhilosopher's Stone created...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.49,0:11:28.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ed! Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.86,0:11:30.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long are you\Ngoing to sleep in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:31.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:33.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:44.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A simple chemical reaction like this\Nis one of the fundamentals of alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:53.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.52,0:11:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:11:59.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me, Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.86,0:12:04.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I encased Al snugly inside bronze.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:07.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There aren't any seams, so as long as\Nthey don't break it in half,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.53,0:12:09.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's no way\Nthey'll know it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.07,0:12:14.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're leaving again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.58,0:12:16.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nthat we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:20.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know! You're going to\Nreturn Al to normal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:23.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can hide here and do your research, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you going to take revenge for Hughes-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.47,0:12:31.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we won't take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:36.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Scar's death \Nwill have been meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.68,0:12:37.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...\NEven so,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:40.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's still something\Nthat we must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.65,0:12:45.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something more important than revenge, and what you've been searching for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:50.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yow-ow-ow-ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.49,0:12:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm doing your braid for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That's okay, I'll do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:55.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.74,0:12:59.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:03.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not anything dangerous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.22,0:13:17.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, where could Dad have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:19.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:24.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deterioration of the soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.73,0:13:30.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As our souls have been repeatedly transferred into different bodies, they have eroded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.82,0:13:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our souls no longer have the power to sustain their bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.49,0:13:39.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dante, we are going to perish like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.41,0:13:43.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I just need the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.37,0:13:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can always take a new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:47.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will happen again immediately after moving to that body,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.67,0:13:49.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the same will be true of the next body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.55,0:13:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll move into\Nanother new body!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.92,0:13:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about the Philosopher's Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.97,0:13:59.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must have used the last bit I left you \Nto transfer into that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:04.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is why those boys have made the next Stone for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.19,0:14:09.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Ishbalan man has turned your son \Ninto a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.65,0:14:14.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dante-sama, then it really is true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:19.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.99,0:15:01.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I saw Edward and Alphonse, I should have realized...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.45,0:15:03.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what they had done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.29,0:15:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I didn't want to believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trisha...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:19.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will always be dear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.81,0:15:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Hohenheim of Light.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:32.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To think that you could be beaten by a homunculus, of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:37.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ever since you left, I've been\Ndoing some research of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.24,0:15:42.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That gate, which is the source of power for alchemy—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:45.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What lies on the other side of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.45,0:15:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't there a way\Nto open the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:54.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gate is inside of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:16:00.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, someone whose bond between body, mind, and soul is still weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:02.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,say, as is the case for this baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is able to call forth the gate\Neven stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:08.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shall we perform an experiment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to see what the other side of the gate is like?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.33,0:16:31.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tri...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.58,0:16:34.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Ed and Al are all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.34,0:16:36.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are... your children.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:47.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.43,0:16:51.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:54.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't ever have to go back to the other side of that gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.61,0:17:03.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring the Philosopher's Stone here, \NWrath, Sloth, and Lust.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:16.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that you...\Ncan be reborn once again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:20.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once I have the Philosopher's Stone, and after my soul has been bonded,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.17,0:17:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I really will turn\Nyou all into humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:25.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it all depends on my mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here is your baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have to eat more,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.91,0:17:55.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or you won't be able to fit into my dress sizes, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.71,0:17:58.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Search carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a possibility that they've changed their hair and eye color.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:02.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A large man and a runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.67,0:18:05.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The runt is as small as a bean sprout, so don't overlook him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:11.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not the one, huh? The one we're searching for is as small as a baby ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.14,0:18:12.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:15.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We found an odd bronze sculpture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.94,0:18:16.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How big is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.19,0:18:20.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks larger than the suit of armor in the dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:22.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmm, just to be safe, \Nwe'll smash it with a hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.45,0:18:27.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:29.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:36.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:37.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're that man from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:40.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the bean sprout we heard about!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:41.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:46.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.72,0:18:51.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, I can very well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.10,0:18:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.66,0:19:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:10.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, don't use any alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:13.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.79,0:19:15.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remembered the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.50,0:19:17.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And besides, I'm a Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.50,0:19:19.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can probably do it,\Njust like you do, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:20.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:26.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know what will happen if you use alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.38,0:19:29.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take our time to research it,\Nand I'll return you to your original body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.22,0:19:33.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll take everything from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.89,0:19:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:37.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like that bastard said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.73,0:19:40.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's someone pulling\Nthe strings of the homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:44.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something I'm going to need\Nin order to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:45.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.15,0:19:48.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can stay.\NI'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.91,0:19:49.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.03,0:19:52.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can look after things here by yourself, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.30,0:20:13.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The two of us have been ordered to take command of the expeditionary forces in the north, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.43,0:20:15.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.39,0:20:16.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.43,0:20:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They have to know we've been in contact with Ed and Al,\Nbecause of the matter\Nwith the secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:25.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet, they're sending us off to the front,\Nwithout the least bit of censure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.73,0:20:29.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they were going to shut us up,\Nthey could just attack us here in Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.90,0:20:31.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There {\i1}is{\i0} the matter of Hughes, and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.99,0:20:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If they were to use the same tactic again,\Nit would arouse suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.91,0:20:38.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the battlefield, they can kill us\Nwhenever they please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.33,0:20:41.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Afterwards, even if they do turn up\Nany documents, they can just sit on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.50,0:20:45.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still, even now, I can't \Nbelieve that he could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.01,0:20:51.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times I read over the materials that Scieszka gave me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.43,0:20:53.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't unravel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.55,0:20:55.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This was the final\Npart of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've given yourself away, haven't you, \Nyou miserable homunculus?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you\Nwould have stayed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:06.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You never know what's going on\Nright under your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.40,0:21:10.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I wanted to look through\Nsome of the things that Dante had.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.90,0:21:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.45,0:21:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.99,0:21:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly,\Nwhat are you here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.45,0:21:20.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think it will just\Nget you mad at me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:23.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.21,0:21:27.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something that I absolutely have to get my hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:34.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, is there any part of your\Ndead baby's body still remaining?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.47,0:21:38.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to fight them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.93,0:21:40.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:45.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.32,0:21:50.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.12,0:22:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so... so good of you\Nto come, Alphonse-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.29,0:22:09.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please teach me how to use the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.89,0:23:40.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:43.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 46: "Human Transmutation"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.97,0:23:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to\Nbecome human—
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.56,0:23:48.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,something so worthless?
